# The container image for `apps/computer-host` is built with the repository
# root as its context, because the image needs
# `packages/computer-host-{protocol,runtime}` alongside `apps/computer-host`.
# Everything else stays out of the context.
*
!apps/computer-host
!packages/computer-host-protocol
!packages/computer-host-runtime
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/out
**/.wrangler
**/.dev.vars
